Kilix continuation and synthetic command data by itsmygithubacct.
LoRA rank 16, alpha 32; full 20-layer model; CQ W4 / A8 export.
This continuation uses 24,400 synthetic examples, learning rate 0.00001,
two training epochs, and checkpoint selection on 700 development cases.
